    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Pipeline", "items": [
      "Manifest order drives the loop; each document becomes one PDF",
      "ZipReader extracts only manifest-listed entries, paths normalized",
      "PdfMerger copies pages in order with pdf-lib, uninterruptible"
    ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Isolation & cleanup", "items": [
      "Each request gets a /tmp/doctopdf-* job dir, removed on scope exit",
      "soffice runs detached in its own process group, SIGTERM then SIGKILL",
      "Chromium renders theme-expanded HTML, A4 print background on"
    ] },
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "Config & shutdown", "items": [
      "RenderConfig resolves port, timeouts and delimiter pairs from env",
      "Every service reads its own settings from RenderConfig via layers",
      "Shutdown drains intake, interrupts request fibers, releases layers"
